# Mechanical: what a machine writes for any contract. Complete and visible, and not pleasant.

SCREEN Home:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Alice: identity, person
    LIST People: EVERYONE WITH knows, note, escrow_note, member, has_member, post, delivered_post, escrow_item OPENS Person
    LIST Made: "Alice has made Item"
    LIST Item: "Alice holds the item Item"
    LIST Keeper: "Alice is the keeper of Mart"
    LIST Posted: "Alice has posted Item to Mart"
    Establish: Alice may establish an identity
    Acquaint: Alice and Bob may jointly come to know each other, Bob TYPED
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Carol to Bob, Bob FROM knows, Carol FROM knows
    Issue: Alice may issue Sum Alice-notes of type Type, Type TYPED, Sum TYPED
    Swap: Alice and Bob may jointly swap Sum Carol-notes of type Type for Total Dave-notes of type Other, Bob FROM knows, Carol FROM note, Dave TYPED, Type FROM note, Sum TYPED, Other TYPED, Total TYPED
    Pay: Alice may pay Bob Sum Carol-notes of type Type, Bob FROM knows, Carol FROM note, Type FROM note, Sum TYPED
    Pay issuer: Bob FROM knows, Type FROM note, Sum TYPED
    Deposit: Alice may deposit Sum Dave-notes of type Type with Carol for Bob on Cond, Carol FROM knows, Dave FROM note, Bob FROM knows, Type FROM note, Sum TYPED, Cond TYPED
    Release: Alice and Bob may jointly release Sum Dave-notes of type Type that Carol deposited on Cond, Bob FROM knows, Dave FROM escrow_note, Carol FROM escrow_note, Type FROM escrow_note, Cond FROM escrow_note, Sum TYPED
    Return: Alice and Bob may jointly return Sum Dave-notes of type Type deposited for Carol on Cond, Bob FROM knows, Dave FROM escrow_note, Carol FROM escrow_note, Type FROM escrow_note, Cond FROM escrow_note, Sum TYPED
    Redeem: Alice may redeem a Bob-coin against a Carol-coin, Bob FROM knows, Carol TYPED
    Redeem coin against bond: Alice may redeem a Bob-coin against a Carol-bond due Day, Bob FROM knows, Carol TYPED
    Redeem bond: Alice may redeem a Bob-bond due Day against a Carol-coin, Bob FROM knows, Carol TYPED
    Redeem bond against bond: Alice may redeem a Bob-bond due Day against a Carol-bond due Term, Bob FROM knows, Carol TYPED
    Make: Alice may make the item Item, Item TYPED
    Open: Alice may open Mart under a new name of hers, Mart TYPED
    Join: Alice may admit Bob to Mart, Bob FROM knows, Mart FROM keeper
    Offer: Alice may post Item to the wall of Bob's Mart, Bob FROM member, Item FROM item, Mart FROM member
    Offer own: Alice may post Item to the wall of Alice's Mart, Item FROM item, Mart FROM member
    Want: Alice may post Wish to the wall of Bob's Mart, Bob FROM member, Wish TYPED, Mart FROM member
    Want own: Alice may post Wish to the wall of Alice's Mart, Wish TYPED, Mart FROM member
    Withdraw: Alice may withdraw her post of Item in Bob's Mart, Bob TYPED, Item TYPED, Mart TYPED
    Withdraw own: Alice may withdraw her post of Item in Alice's Mart, Item FROM post, Mart FROM post
    Swap item for coin: Alice and Bob may jointly swap the item Item for Sum Dave-coins, Bob FROM knows, Dave TYPED, Item FROM item, Sum TYPED
    Swap item for bond: Alice and Bob may jointly swap the item Item for Sum Dave-bonds due Day, Bob FROM knows, Dave TYPED, Item FROM item, Sum TYPED
    Swap items: Alice and Bob may jointly swap the item Item for the item Thing, Bob FROM knows, Item FROM item, Thing TYPED
    Deposit item: Alice may deposit the item Item with Carol for Bob on Cond, Carol FROM knows, Bob FROM knows, Item FROM item, Cond TYPED
    Release item: Alice and Bob may jointly release the item Item that Carol deposited on Cond, Bob FROM knows, Carol FROM escrow_item, Item FROM escrow_item, Cond FROM escrow_item
    Return item: Alice and Bob may jointly return the item Item deposited for Carol on Cond, Bob FROM knows, Carol FROM escrow_item, Item FROM escrow_item, Cond FROM escrow_item

SCREEN Person ABOUT Bob:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Bob: knows, note, escrow_note, member, has_member, post, delivered_post, escrow_item
